---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About FreeToolBox - Free Online Tools" description="FreeToolBox offers 150+ free online tools for developers, writers and marketers. All tools run client-side. No signup, no limits.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">About FreeToolBox</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>FreeToolBox is a collection of <strong>150+ free online tools</strong> built for developers, writers, marketers, students and professionals.</p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>We believe useful tools should be accessible to everyone, without barriers. No signup required, no usage limits, no hidden fees, no data collection.</p>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p>Every tool runs <strong>100% in your browser</strong>. Your data never leaves your device. We use client-side JavaScript to process everything locally — no server uploads, no cloud processing, no tracking.</p>

      <h2>Categories</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Developer Tools</strong> — JSON formatters, CSS generators, code converters, regex testers</li>
        <li><strong>PDF Tools</strong> — Merge, split, compress, convert PDFs entirely client-side</li>
        <li><strong>Text Tools</strong> — Word counters, case converters, text-to-speech, grammar checkers</li>
        <li><strong>SEO Tools</strong> — Meta tag generators, schema markup, sitemap builders</li>
        <li><strong>Utility Tools</strong> — Image tools, calculators, timers, converters</li>
        <li><strong>Security Tools</strong> — Password checkers, hash tools, header generators</li>
        <li><strong>Business Tools</strong> — Invoice generators, ROI calculators, pricing tools</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Technology</h2>
      <p>Built with Astro, Tailwind CSS and vanilla JavaScript. Hosted on Cloudflare Pages for maximum speed worldwide.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions or suggestions? Visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
